{"id":"cd4cd5d7f9d5cf46","group":"58","path":"58/batch14/58-df-zfc-geology-modal-validity.md","title":"ZFC Geology Modal Validity","display":"df-zfc-geology-modal-validity — ZFC Geology Modal Validity","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-geology-modal-validity","aliases":["58-df-zfc-geology-modal-validity"],"display":"df-zfc-geology-modal-validity — ZFC Geology Modal Validity","depends_on":["[[../batch06/58-df-ground.md]]","[[../batch06/58-df-zfc-inner3-transitive-class-model.md]]","[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]","[[../batch17/58-df-formula.md]]","[[../batch07/58-df-free-variable.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-geology-modal-validity"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-geology-modal-validity</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-geology-modal-validity — ZFC Geology Modal Validity"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"d0244462250ae67e\" href=\"?note=d0244462250ae67e\" title=\"../batch06/58-df-ground.md\">../batch06/58-df-ground.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"150182b44c47c043\" href=\"?note=150182b44c47c043\" title=\"../batch06/58-df-zfc-inner3-transitive-class-model.md\">../batch06/58-df-zfc-inner3-transitive-class-model.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-function.md\">../batch16/58-df-function.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"65418b505fc53093\" href=\"?note=65418b505fc53093\" title=\"../batch17/58-df-formula.md\">../batch17/58-df-formula.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"715a32e91161b34f\" href=\"?note=715a32e91161b34f\" title=\"../batch07/58-df-free-variable.md\">../batch07/58-df-free-variable.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Prop},\\varphi,\\psi,\\sigma\\in V\">\\(\\operatorname{Prop},\\varphi,\\psi,\\sigma\\in V\\)</span>, while <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"U,W\\in\\mathsf{Cls}\">\\(U,W\\in\\mathsf{Cls}\\)</span> are class parameters.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ML}_n(\\operatorname{Prop})\">\\(\\mathrm{ML}_n(\\operatorname{Prop})\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ML}(\\operatorname{Prop})\">\\(\\mathrm{ML}(\\operatorname{Prop})\\)</span> are the modal-formula stages and their union defined here.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{GroundModel}_S\\subseteq V^2\">\\(\\mathrm{GroundModel}_S\\subseteq V^2\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"d0244462250ae67e\" href=\"?note=d0244462250ae67e\" title=\"../batch06/58-df-ground.md\">../batch06/58-df-ground.md</a>).</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcInner3TransitiveClassModel}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcInner3TransitiveClassModel}_S\\)</span> is the transitive class-model predicate from <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"150182b44c47c043\" href=\"?note=150182b44c47c043\" title=\"../batch06/58-df-zfc-inner3-transitive-class-model.md\">../batch06/58-df-zfc-inner3-transitive-class-model.md</a>.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Function}\">\\(\\mathrm{Function}\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Fml}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{Fml}_S\\)</span>, and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FV}\">\\(\\operatorname{FV}\\)</span> are as in the cited syntax dependencies.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(U,\\in)\\models_{\\mathsf{Cls}}\\theta\">\\((U,\\in)\\models_{\\mathsf{Cls}}\\theta\\)</span> denotes the class-satisfaction schema of the ambient two-sorted metatheory.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ModalGroundSat}_{\\mathrm{meta}}\">\\(\\mathrm{ModalGroundSat}_{\\mathrm{meta}}\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcGeologyModalValidity}_{\\mathrm{meta}}\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcGeologyModalValidity}_{\\mathrm{meta}}\\)</span> are defined here.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}geology\\text{-}modal\\text{-}syntax\\text{-}zero}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ML}_0(\\operatorname{Prop})\\coloneqq\\operatorname{Prop}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}geology\\text{-}modal\\text{-}syntax\\text{-}zero}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ML}_0(\\operatorname{Prop})\\coloneqq\\operatorname{Prop}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}geology\\text{-}modal\\text{-}syntax\\text{-}successor}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ML}_{n+1}(\\operatorname{Prop})\\coloneqq\n\\mathrm{ML}_n(\\operatorname{Prop})\n\\cup\\{\\neg\\theta:\\theta\\in\\mathrm{ML}_n(\\operatorname{Prop})\\}\n\\cup\\{\\theta\\land\\rho:\\theta,\\rho\\in\\mathrm{ML}_n(\\operatorname{Prop})\\}\n\\cup\\{\\Box\\theta:\\theta\\in\\mathrm{ML}_n(\\operatorname{Prop})\\}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}geology\\text{-}modal\\text{-}syntax\\text{-}successor}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ML}_{n+1}(\\operatorname{Prop})\\coloneqq\n\\mathrm{ML}_n(\\operatorname{Prop})\n\\cup\\{\\neg\\theta:\\theta\\in\\mathrm{ML}_n(\\operatorname{Prop})\\}\n\\cup\\{\\theta\\land\\rho:\\theta,\\rho\\in\\mathrm{ML}_n(\\operatorname{Prop})\\}\n\\cup\\{\\Box\\theta:\\theta\\in\\mathrm{ML}_n(\\operatorname{Prop})\\}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}geology\\text{-}modal\\text{-}syntax}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ML}(\\operatorname{Prop})\\coloneqq\\bigcup_{n\\in\\omega}\\mathrm{ML}_n(\\operatorname{Prop})\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}geology\\text{-}modal\\text{-}syntax}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ML}(\\operatorname{Prop})\\coloneqq\\bigcup_{n\\in\\omega}\\mathrm{ML}_n(\\operatorname{Prop})\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}geology\\text{-}modal\\text{-}satisfaction}\\vdash_{\\mathrm{meta}}{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{ModalGroundSat}_{\\mathrm{meta}}(U,\\sigma,p)\\leftrightarrow\n(U,\\in)\\models_{\\mathsf{Cls}}\\sigma(p)\\quad(p\\in\\operatorname{Prop}),\\\\\n&amp;\\mathrm{ModalGroundSat}_{\\mathrm{meta}}(U,\\sigma,\\neg\\varphi)\\leftrightarrow\n\\neg\\mathrm{ModalGroundSat}_{\\mathrm{meta}}(U,\\sigma,\\varphi),\\\\\n&amp;\\mathrm{ModalGroundSat}_{\\mathrm{meta}}(U,\\sigma,\\varphi\\land\\psi)\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{ModalGroundSat}_{\\mathrm{meta}}(U,\\sigma,\\varphi)\\land\\mathrm{ModalGroundSat}_{\\mathrm{meta}}(U,\\sigma,\\psi),\\\\\n&amp;\\mathrm{ModalGroundSat}_{\\mathrm{meta}}(U,\\sigma,\\Box\\varphi)\\leftrightarrow\n\\forall W\\in\\mathsf{Cls}\\;(\\mathrm{GroundModel}_S(W,U)\\to\n\\mathrm{ModalGroundSat}_{\\mathrm{meta}}(W,\\sigma,\\varphi)).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}geology\\text{-}modal\\text{-}satisfaction}\\vdash_{\\mathrm{meta}}{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{ModalGroundSat}_{\\mathrm{meta}}(U,\\sigma,p)\\leftrightarrow\n(U,\\in)\\models_{\\mathsf{Cls}}\\sigma(p)\\quad(p\\in\\operatorname{Prop}),\\\\\n&amp;\\mathrm{ModalGroundSat}_{\\mathrm{meta}}(U,\\sigma,\\neg\\varphi)\\leftrightarrow\n\\neg\\mathrm{ModalGroundSat}_{\\mathrm{meta}}(U,\\sigma,\\varphi),\\\\\n&amp;\\mathrm{ModalGroundSat}_{\\mathrm{meta}}(U,\\sigma,\\varphi\\land\\psi)\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{ModalGroundSat}_{\\mathrm{meta}}(U,\\sigma,\\varphi)\\land\\mathrm{ModalGroundSat}_{\\mathrm{meta}}(U,\\sigma,\\psi),\\\\\n&amp;\\mathrm{ModalGroundSat}_{\\mathrm{meta}}(U,\\sigma,\\Box\\varphi)\\leftrightarrow\n\\forall W\\in\\mathsf{Cls}\\;(\\mathrm{GroundModel}_S(W,U)\\to\n\\mathrm{ModalGroundSat}_{\\mathrm{meta}}(W,\\sigma,\\varphi)).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}geology\\text{-}modal\\text{-}validity}\\vdash_{\\mathrm{meta}}{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{ZfcGeologyModalValidity}_{\\mathrm{meta}}(\\varphi,U)\\\\\n\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{ZfcInner3TransitiveClassModel}_S(U)\\land\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{ML}(\\operatorname{Prop})\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall\\sigma\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{Function}\\bigl(\\sigma,\\operatorname{Prop},\n\\{\\theta\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S(\\{\\in\\}):\\operatorname{FV}_{\\{\\in\\}}(\\theta)=\\varnothing\\}\\bigr)\n\\to\\mathrm{ModalGroundSat}_{\\mathrm{meta}}(U,\\sigma,\\varphi)\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}geology\\text{-}modal\\text{-}validity}\\vdash_{\\mathrm{meta}}{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{ZfcGeologyModalValidity}_{\\mathrm{meta}}(\\varphi,U)\\\\\n\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{ZfcInner3TransitiveClassModel}_S(U)\\land\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{ML}(\\operatorname{Prop})\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall\\sigma\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{Function}\\bigl(\\sigma,\\operatorname{Prop},\n\\{\\theta\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S(\\{\\in\\}):\\operatorname{FV}_{\\{\\in\\}}(\\theta)=\\varnothing\\}\\bigr)\n\\to\\mathrm{ModalGroundSat}_{\\mathrm{meta}}(U,\\sigma,\\varphi)\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Modal operators are interpreted recursively over the ground-model accessibility relation, and validity quantifies over all propositional substitutions.</li>\n<li>Ground models are proper-class parameters in this subject, so their atomic truth is evaluated by the class-satisfaction schema rather than the set-structure satisfaction predicate.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch06/58-df-ground.md","status":"resolved","id":"d0244462250ae67e","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch06/58-df-ground.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch06/58-df-zfc-inner3-transitive-class-model.md","status":"resolved","id":"150182b44c47c043","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch06/58-df-zfc-inner3-transitive-class-model.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch16/58-df-function.md","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch17/58-df-formula.md","status":"resolved","id":"65418b505fc53093","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch17/58-df-formula.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch07/58-df-free-variable.md","status":"resolved","id":"715a32e91161b34f","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch07/58-df-free-variable.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch06/58-df-ground.md","status":"resolved","id":"d0244462250ae67e","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","h